# The Shofar Bee — what GitHub Pages actually serves is:
#   index.html, day*.html, schedule.js, shofar-bee-banner.png,
#   .nojekyll, README.md and tools/*.ps1
# Everything below is working material that lives in the same folder
# but should stay out of the repo, so `git status` only shows real
# changes to the site.

# ── Source documents, research and exports ───────────────────────
*.doc
*.docx
*.docm
*.pdf
*.ppt
*.pptx
*.zip
*.lnk
*.jpg
Graph.png

# ── Solver output and puzzle word lists ──────────────────────────
*.txt

# ── Draft puzzle pages (only day*.html / index.html are published) ─
DRAFT_*.html

# ── Ad-hoc working folders ───────────────────────────────────────
files for day 7/
files for fixing Day 6/
new puzzle word lists*/
New words*/

# ── Office / editor temp and lock files ──────────────────────────
~$*
*.tmp

# ── Local tooling config ─────────────────────────────────────────
.claude/
